TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium, O2 at log PO2=-0.7, allow goethite and gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file pyrite_ox.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -alkalinity true
    -totals Fe S(6) S(-2) Ca
END
